	"_comment": [
		"Hand-written Arabic for the strings HikaShop has no word for. Merged over the ones taken from",
		"HikaShop's own ar-AA file by tools/build-locales.mjs, so regenerating keeps these.",
		"Arabic counts in six: zero, one, two, few (3-10), many (11-99) and other (100+). The counted",
		"strings carry all six, because the noun really does change: متغير واحد، متغيران، 3 متغيرات،",
		"11 متغيرًا، 100 متغير.",
		"Right to left; the app sets dir from the locale, so nothing here carries markup for it.",
		"Modern Standard Arabic, as the HikaShop backend uses."
